Description: Note removal of ui/gfx/ipc/skia dependency (removed in CEF 147)
 Chromium removed the ui/gfx/ipc/skia/ directory and its BUILD.gn target.
 CEF 147 upstream already removed this dependency. This patch adds a comment
 noting the removal for documentation purposes.
 .
 Previous versions of this patch removed the dependency line, but it no longer
 exists in CEF 147.
Author: Juan Manuel Méndez Rey <juan.mendezr@proton.me>
Bug-Debian: https://bugs.debian.org/915400
Forwarded: not-needed
Last-Update: 2026-04-10

diff --git a/cef/BUILD.gn b/cef/BUILD.gn
index 2347310..e64120f 100644
--- a/cef/BUILD.gn
+++ b/cef/BUILD.gn
@@ -1000,6 +1000,7 @@ source_set("libcef_static") {
     "//ui/gfx/geometry",
     "//ui/gfx/ipc",
     "//ui/gfx/ipc/geometry",
+    # Note: //ui/gfx/ipc/skia was removed upstream in CEF 147
     "//ui/gl",
     "//ui/strings",
     "//ui/views",
